{{en-verb|pres_ptc2=macheteing}}

# To cut or chop with a machete.
#: {{ux|en|After some hours of intense work, we had '''macheted''' a path through the jungle to the bank of the river.}}
# To hack or chop crudely with a blade other than a machete.
#: {{ux|en|You can't just '''machete''' about with a rapier and expect to succeed; you need to thrust properly.}}

